Package: metascrub
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pil, python3-mutagen, python3-pypdf, python3-pyside6
Maintainer: Vanguard Arts SRL <https://vanguardarts.vip/>
Homepage: https://github.com/VanguardArts/metascrub
Description: inspect and strip metadata from images, audio and documents
 Metascrub is a unified GUI (and CLI) for inspecting and removing
 identifying metadata — EXIF, ID3, C2PA provenance, and PDF/document
 properties — from images, audio and document files. Detect hidden metadata
 and embedded thumbnails, compare files before/after sanitization, and batch
 process or monitor entire folders.
 .
 Free basic version with an optional Pro tier (€9–19) via vanguardarts.vip.
